# Reject known-secret shapes even if a future pull/add forgets to filter them.
# These names should never appear anywhere under unifi/.
**/tailscaled.state
**/profile-data/
**/dns-cache/
**/derpmap.cached.json
**/*.key
**/*.pem
**/*.p12
**/*.pfx
**/id_rsa*
**/id_ed25519*
# Belt-and-braces: anything claiming to be process state (tailscaled.state is
# the specific worry, but any `*.state` under unifi/ is almost certainly a
# runtime file that must not be shadowed in git).
**/*.state
**/*.vlt
**/*.vlt.uuid
# Linked-IP update token file (nextdns setup page writes a per-profile token
# under /data when linked IP is configured; it is a secret the way an API key
# is).
**/.nextdns-update-token*
# Integration API key read by nextdns-client-names/sync.sh on the UDM Pro.
**/api-key
# Historical: unifi/backup/ was dropped on 2026-10-14 because UniFi Cloud
# already backs up the controller state and the raw dumps carry WPA/SSH/SSO
# secrets. Reject any accidental re-creation of that path.
backup/
